quran[8]{c,v,t}:
  29,31,"And when Our messengers came to Ibrahim (Abraham) with the good news, they said: ‘We are indeed going to destroy the people of this town. Its people are indeed wrongdoers.’"
  29,32,"He (Abraham) said: ‘Lut (Lot) is indeed in it.’ They said: ‘We know better who is in it. We shall surely save him and his family, except his wife. She will be among those who are going to stay behind.’"
  29,33,"And when Our messengers came to Lut (Lot), he was upset on their account and felt distressed for their sake. But they said: ‘Do not fear, nor grieve! We shall deliver you and your family, except your wife. She will be among those who are going to stay behind."
  29,34,We are indeed going to bring down upon the people of this town a punishment from heaven because they have been transgressors.’
  29,35,"Indeed, We have left some (ruined remains) of it as a clear sign for people who understand."
  29,36,"To Madyan, (We sent) their (kin) brother Shu‘ayb. So he said: ‘O my people! Worship Allah and hope for the Last Day. And do not act wickedly upon the earth, causing corruption.’"
  29,37,"But they rejected him, so a severe earthquake overtook them. And in the early morning, they became lifeless bodies lying in their homes."
  29,38,"And (We destroyed) ‘Ad and Thamud (as well). It is undoubtedly apparent to you from their (ruined) dwellings. Satan made their deeds look charming to them, so he turned them away from the path (of truth), though they were wise and discerning."
